{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "560499fa5dc8d81c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT:\n  - ipynb file (Jupyter notebook)\n\n  ---\n\n  PROCESS:\n  - extract_ipynb_as_strings() reads the notebook JSON structure\n  - iterates through cells array\n  - separates code cells from markdown cells\n  - preserves original cell order\n  - adds cell number comments as separators\n\n  ---\n\n  OUTPUTS:\n  - Python string (all code cells concatenated with separators)\n  - Markdown string (all markdown cells concatenated with separators)",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": -2960,
      "y": 1830,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 560
    },
    {
      "id": "9537649fbf955972",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "SEPARATE CODE",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": -2880,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "42d84be884574ac9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": -2600,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b3e1ea8dedeabbc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": " INPUT:\n  - Python code string (extracted from notebook)\n\n  ---\n\n  PROCESS:\n  - ENHANCED_EXPLANATION_PROMPT template receives code\n  - LLM analyzes code structure\n  - identifies logical blocks (imports, classes, functions, etc.)\n  - maps dependencies between blocks\n  - determines execution flow\n\n  ---\n\n  OUTPUTS:\n  - JSON structure containing:\n    - overview (2-3 sentence summary)\n    - blocks array (id, name, description, content, dependencies)\n    - edges array (dependency graph)\n    - execution_order array",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": -2340,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 620
    },
    {
      "id": "52b36807b45eadea",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INITIAL ANALYSIS",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": -2260,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "7e82ac51a71cdfe6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT:\n- CodeBlock object (from initial analysis)\n- CodeExplanation context (overview, all blocks, edges)\n- Connected blocks summary (from format_connected_blocks)\n\n  ---\n\nPROCESS:\n-  COMPONENT_EXTRACTION_PROMPT template receives:\n\t- Block code content\n\t- Block description and ID\n\t- Connected blocks context\n- LLM decomposes block into components:\n\t- Identifies component types (import, class, function, etc.)\n\t- Assigns sequential numbers\n\t- Maps parent-child relationships\n\t- Tracks internal calls/dependencies\n- Component validation:\n\t- Checks for external dependencies\n\t- Sets is_resolved status\n\n  ---\n\nOUTPUTS:\n- ComponentAnalysis containing:\n\t- components array with each component having:\n\t\t- name, number, type, library\n\t\t- code (exact content)\n\t\t- description\n\t\t- parent/children relationships\n\t\t- calls/called_by references\n- Updates to WalkthroughState:\n\t- component_states populated\n\t- global registries updated\n\t- is_completed flag set (true if no external deps)",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": -1440,
      "y": 1550,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 1140
    },
    {
      "id": "57ec707aa14dca4c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "COMPONENT EXTRACTION",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": -1350,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ffe38231d3e258a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": -1060,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2cc1b645943ab",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT: \n- ExplanationState JSON\n\n---\n\nPROCESS:\n- Creates Tree and Graph\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Graph \n\t- Grouped by phases (all phases 1 group color)\n\t- Parent component grouped with it's children (aka nested - different group color for each level, also smaller nodes?)\n- Tree View",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": -695,
      "y": 2525,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 540
    },
    {
      "id": "018b5748be764939",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "  INPUT:\n\t- BlockState with pending_dependencies\n\t- Global component registry (all analyzed components)\n\t- Dependency context (external component descriptions)\n\n  ---\n\n  PROCESS:\n- Identify unresolved components (is_resolved=false)\n- Gather dependency context:\n\t- Look up external components in global registry\n\t- Build context with their descriptions\n- enhance_with_dependencies:\n\t- LLM receives component + dependency context\n\t- Generates enhanced description explaining interactions\n\t- Updates confidence scores\n- Mark components as resolved\n\n  ---\n\nOUTPUTS:\n- Enhanced component descriptions\n- Updated component states:\n\t- enhanced_description populated\n\t- is_resolved set to true\n- BlockState marked as fully_analyzed",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": -75,
      "y": 806,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 920
    },
    {
      "id": "1ba4050eeafcab82",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "DEPENDENCY RESOLUTION",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 15,
      "y": 776,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8acd02e4f6aa780",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 305,
      "y": 776,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "8176aab22e565062",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT:\n- BlockState (fully analyzed)\n- All component descriptions (initial or enhanced)\n- Block metadata and relationships\n\n  ---\n\n PROCESS:\n- Aggregate component insights:\n\t- Use enhanced_description if available\n\t- Otherwise use initial description\n- Combine into comprehensive block description:\n\t- Original block description\n\t- Component-level details\n\t- Cross-component interactions\n- Generate execution flow narrative\n\n  ---\n\nOUTPUTS:\n- deep_description for block\n- Comprehensive understanding combining:\n\t  - What the block does\n\t  - How components work together\n\t  - External dependencies explained",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": -75,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 720
    },
    {
      "id": "8c550d8ae4fd9395",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "DEEP DESCRIPTION GENERATION",
      "styleAttributes": {
