    {
      "id": "52214d5932359433",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Token usage counter feature\n\nADD HASH TRACKING FOR CHANGES LIKE EMBER.PY\n\nHighlighting on blocks gives information similar to what we have in this canvas: INPUT, PROCESS, OUTPUT",
      "styleAttributes": {},
