    {
      "id": "662cc68e1ff4d99b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "PHASE DEEP DESCRIPTION GENERATION",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 2269,
      "y": 4920,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2a219ee553c1cd9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2599,
      "y": 4920,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3c2c68b21937e2c8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT: \n- (async) For PhaseState in PhaseStateList:\n\n---\n\nPROCESS:\n- Prompt to generate Deep Description\n\t- Code Overview\n\t- Initial Description\n\t- (all) children in ComponentStateList\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT:\n- PhaseStateList\n\t- PhaseState[\"Deep Description\"]",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2199,
      "y": 4950,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 440
    },
    {
      "id": "3a5638d6edd3ce95",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT:\n- JSON of initial explanation\n\t- Overview\n\t- Phases\n\t\t- Description\n\t\t- Components (make all are assigned)\n\n---\n\nPROCESS:\n- Convert JSON to state\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT:\n- ExplanationState\n\t- Code Overview\n\t- PhasteStateList\n\t\t- PhaseState\n\t\t\t- State Name\n\t\t\t- State Number\n\t\t\t- Parent Phases\n\t\t\t- Children Phases\n\t\t\t- Initial Description\n\t\t\t- Deep Description (null)\n\t\t\t- ComponentStateList\n\t\t\t\t- ComponentState\n\t\t\t\t\t- Component Name\n\t\t\t\t\t- Component Number\n\t\t\t\t\t- Type (class, func, var, etc.)\n\t\t\t\t\t- Library (or built-in)\n\t\t\t\t\t- Full Code\n\t\t\t\t\t- Description (null)\n\t\t\t\t\t- Belonged Phase\n\t\t\t\t\t- Parent Component(s)\n\t\t\t\t\t- Child Component(s)\n\t\t\t\t\t- Called Components\n\t\t\t\t\t- Called-by Components",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2159,
      "y": 5610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 1020
    },
    {
      "id": "64330e2c569f2ed2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CREATE STATES",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 2269,
      "y": 5580,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "356864aaa2cbdeb3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "LLM COMPONENT DESCRIPTOR",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 2959,
      "y": 5170,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "d36d4d0cc5a9a7ce",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CONTEXT7 COMPONENT DESCRIPTOR",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 2739,
      "y": 6570,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "3cee50a2a7e2ca9b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "\n\n\n\n\nNPUT: \n- ComponentStates independent of other functions\n\n---\n\nPROCESS: (async)\n- Use Context7 to explain to get context of functions\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT:\n- List of components not in Context7\n- ComponentState[\"Description\"]",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2849,
      "y": 6620,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 480
    },
    {
      "id": "e10dac09e48d8815",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "COMPONENT DESCRIPTION ASSIGNMENT",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 2739,
      "y": 5750,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "386b19d0a062c913",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT: \n- (async) For PhaseState in PhaseStateList:\n\n---\n\nPROCESS (async)\n- If called components, await \n- For Components not dependent on others\n\t- Calls Content7 Component Descriptor\n- For those dependent on something or not found in Context7\n\t- Calls LLM Component Descriptor\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT:\n- ComponentStateList\n\t- ComponentState[\"Description\"]",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2849,
      "y": 5810,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "4852e1d739f4f7a6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT:\n- ComponentStates\n- Phase's Initial Description\n- Called Components\n\nPROCESS:\n- Passes input and a prompt to LLM to get a description\n\nOUTPUT:\n- ComponentState[\"Description\"]",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2929,
      "y": 5230,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 380
    },
    {
      "id": "d66482c0a3e165c5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "FEED TO LLM",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 1210,
      "y": 4990,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "d90085b9468d2ede",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT: \n- py file\n- md file\n- parsed components\n\n---\n\nPROCESS:\n- feed to LLM with prompt for structured output\n\t- Components should be ordered in order used in phase\n\t- md, if applicable, is to help with additional understanding if it provides any info\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT\n- JSON of following items\n\t- ExplanationState\n\t\t- Code Overview\n\t\t- BlockStateList\n\t\t\t- BlockState\n\t\t\t\t- Block ID\n\t\t\t\t- Block Name\n\t\t\t\t- Initial Pass?\n\t\t\t\t- Initial Description\n\t\t\t\t- Deep Description (null)\n\t\t\t\t- ComponentStateList\n\t\t\t\t\t- ComponentState\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Component Name\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Component Number\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Type (class, func, var, etc.)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Library (or built-in)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Full Code\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Description\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Belonged Phase\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Parent Component(s)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Child Component(s)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Called Components\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Called-by Components\n",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 5020,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 1180
    },
    {
      "id": "f1ffe6dffc3b00e6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT:\n- WalkthroughState with completed deep descriptions\n- All blocks fully analyzed\n- Component descriptions (initial/enhanced)\n\n  ---\n\nPROCESS:\n- Generate comprehensive overview from deep descriptions\n- Judge improvement potential (0-100% score)\n- IF score >= 10%:\n\t- Create selective update plan\n\t- Update overview with architectural insights\n\t- Update specific blocks needing refinement\n\t- Update affected components with context\n\t- Repeat (max 2 iterations)\n- ELSE: Skip iteration\n\n  ---\n\nOUTPUTS:\n- Enhanced code_overview with full architectural understanding\n- Refined deep_descriptions for selected blocks\n- Updated component descriptions with architectural context\n- Improvement metrics (iterations, API calls, scores)",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1422,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 755
    },
    {
      "id": "a56ac517a3d18681",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT:\n  - WalkthroughState with completed deep descriptions\n  - Enhanced component descriptions (initial/enhanced)\n  - Global component registries (functions, classes, imports)\n  - Block states with full architectural understanding\n\n  ---\n  PROCESS:\n  - Generate comprehensive teaching plan from enhanced state\n  - Build dynamic component name mapping and cross-references\n  - Create educational sections with mandatory component linking\n  - IF coverage < 100%:\n    - Apply advanced component linking patterns (1100+ regex patterns)\n    - Run iterative replacement with priority rules (max 3 passes)\n    - Validate component coverage and link quality\n    - Fix broken/duplicate links through post-processing\n    - Repeat until 100% coverage or max iterations\n  - Generate both original and preview versions with universal conversion\n\n  ---\n  OUTPUTS:\n  - Complete educational walkthrough with 100% component coverage\n  - Component links in VS Code extension format: [[component:block:num:name|display]]\n  - Preview version with standard markdown links for presentations\n  - Quality validation report with coverage metrics and link analysis\n  - Component registry for VS Code extension integration\n  - Teaching sections with contextual explanations and guided learning flow",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 1369,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 863
    },
    {
      "id": "4ef74bd321b3041e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1770,
      "y": 1339,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc62ff6c0a6bc819",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "WALKTHROUGH GENERATION",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 1420,
      "y": 1339,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec1f9b7ead176bb6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Take new overview and blocks and feed to planner for walk through, broken apart by each block but still cohesive in order, Also writes brief introduction/overview/purpose\n\nFor each block we run async. Each block gets their block's task list as per planner. Using their deep description and components list, they'll write a walkthrough as well as possible, following the task list order, and making sure to touch upon/mention (but not necessarily explain - unless needed) every component in that block\n\nAsk for less technical tone. with 10 being professor and 1 being a friend, we should be around a 7 or so. Language easy to grasp but still professional\n\n\n\nFor testing, make modules with different prompts for each section to see what kind of results are returned (like changing sensitivity of block count for making sure that each block is manageable in size for understanding and not too overwhelming) - ex evaluation is pretend you're student who knows basic python and are receiving explanations from a teacher. Does this walkthrough block seem manageable to you or overwhelming? What could be done differently?\n",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1230,
      "y": 2325,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 580
    },
    {
      "id": "c7cd8378cab35dca",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Form walkthrough doc for each phase (find out best file type to use for interactivity)\n\n- one section per phase\n- clickable component names\n- \"comment\" box next to each section with previously asked questions IF that question can't be matched to a specific snippet\n\t- if snippet is matched, highlight that in walkthrough (and original ipynb) so when hovered or clicked it shows answers to it",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1280,
      "y": 952,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "c52de9722d14536c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Response printout to user",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2940,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "739005f35372c33a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 3140,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1ec4c697495d1f8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Stores to Database for use in new tooltip\n\nDoes it need to be stored in a vectordb too?",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2940,
      "y": 1550,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "cece7a89a0cf976e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 3140,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2b5d697c24b5047",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "RETURN RESPONSE TO USER",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 2910,
      "y": 1980,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "af56b4ce20689f81",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "INPUT: \n- User Query\n\n---\n\nPROCESS:\n- Passes to an LLM a prompt as well as:\n\t- Phase's Deep Description\n\t- ComponentState[\"Description\"]\n\t- For all edges (to first and last ancestor), all those ComponentState[\"Description\"]\n\t- Overview\n\t- RAG Context\n---\n\nOUTPUT:\n- Response to query",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 510
    },
    {
      "id": "3d496307b3dea45e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Check to see if query is in regards to a certain thing, or more  \"abstract\". If more abstract, find out how to determine what context to pass through and how much context",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 2640,
      "y": 1670,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "8629434e5cb90c58",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "ITERATIVE IMPROVEMENT",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "textAlign": "center"
      },
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1392,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "744fd1092f9b1710",
      "type": "text",
